<section id="about">
  <div class="diag-divider diag-divider--paper" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Who we are</h1>
    <div class="row pad40 reveal">
      <div class="col-md-10 col-md-offset-1">
        <p class="lead-paragraph">
          Magnus Ark is the company behind licensed digital entertainment
          platforms. We hold the license, we build the technology, and we
          run the operations that keep those platforms accountable to the
          people who regulate them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row pad40 reveal">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <p class="left-align">
          We were established to do one thing properly: operate regulated
          entertainment technology in the Philippines at a standard that
          holds up to inspection. That means the systems are engineered
          in-house rather than assembled from parts we do not control. It
          means the teams handling customer accounts, verification, and
          payments sit inside our own organisation, on our own floor, under
          our own training. And it means compliance is designed into the
          platform at the start, not bolted on when an audit is scheduled.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <p class="left-align">
          The Philippine market is young, competitive, and closely watched.
          We think that is the right environment for a company that would
          rather be examined than assumed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about {
    position: relative;
  }

  .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.25em;
    line-height: 1.5em;
  }
</style>
